target/
node_modules/
Cargo.lock
# the gate crate's resolved graph is tracked, and only that one: walk.rs's
# dependency allowlist, the publish matrix and check-gate-binary-fresh's
# git-ls-files source stamp all read it (gate-sdk/SPEC.md §The settings cohort,
# and the crate's first dependency). reserve/ is a name placeholder, not a build.
!native/Cargo.lock
.tmp/
# persistent account-bearing measurement trends (drift-kit/SPEC.md §Layout and
# configuration, DRIFT_KIT_METRIC_DIR) — samples carry account UUIDs and session
# refs, so committing the dir would itself be the leak; never tracked
.metric/
# private brief — local companion context (identity, seam, roadmap), never tracked
BRIEF.local.md
# private ops runbook — DNS records + GitHub settings desired state, never tracked
OPS.local.md
# context-kit env profile — probed machine facts + hand-authored gotchas; local
# config, not memory (context-kit/SPEC.md §The memory-off doctrine), never tracked
ENV.local.md
# private banned-term list for check-commit-msg / check-tree-terms — tracking it
# would itself be the leak (gate-sdk/SPEC.md §check-commit-msg)
scripts/msg-patterns.local.list
# private lesson-harvest sink values — the queue-config overlay carrying a
# downstream sink command; tracking the value would leak it (queue-kit/SPEC.md §lib/queue.sh)
scripts/queue-config.local.sh
# per-user permission grants stay local; the stage skills in commands/ are tracked
.claude/settings.local.json*
# harness-managed worktrees for isolated agents — in-repo, untracked and
# best-effort auto-cleaned, so an in-flight agent would otherwise dirty the tree
# and abort every clean-tree precondition
# (delegation-kit/templates/agent-execution.md). Residue the auto-clean did not
# reap is caught at the iteration boundary, not here: an ignored worktree leaves
# the status clean while it still stands (lifecycle-kit/SPEC.md §bin/enter-stage.sh)
.claude/worktrees/
# guard-kit per-iteration scratch log (cleared at close-stage triage)
.workflow/prompt-friction.log
# guard-kit wakeup-attempt log (advisory close surface, reviewed and deleted at
# the same triage pass as the friction log; unwired here, so it appears only
# where a consumer registers the hook)
.workflow/wakeup-attempts.log
# drift-kit per-iteration scratch log (cleared at close-stage knowledge-friction triage)
.workflow/knowledge-friction.log
# delegation-kit SubagentStop probe log (advisory close surface, cleared at triage)
.workflow/subagent-stop-liveness.log
# outbound lesson-harvest sink ([essay] tag) — operator material feeding the
# launch-comms essay, reclaimed into it then cleared (never tracked)
.workflow/essay-harvest.md
# delegation-kit wait-primitive probe trials (advisory close surface, cleared at triage)
.workflow/wait-primitive-evidence.txt
